          %p
            Observe that the analog of prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PullbackOfUniversalOnBundleUnderCoordinateRestriction"}
            still holds:
          #PullbackOfUniversalBfBundleUnderCoordinateRestriction.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_4 Proposition
            %p
              Given a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28B%2Cf%29-structure"} (B,f)-structure
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℬ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{B}
